pdoor:0:0:12:12:0:10:0:14:0:What is the name of the goddess who threw Hephaestus off Mount Olympus for being ugly? the goddess who cursed Lamia to devour her own children after Zeus loved her? the goddess who sent giant snakes to kill baby Heracles (Hercules)? the goddess who tormented Io by turning her into a cow and sending a gadfly to sting her endlessly? the goddess who cursed Echo to only repeat others’ words after she distracted her from Zeus’ affairs? the goddess who made Leto’s childbirth agonizing by forbidding land to shelter her? the goddess who drove Ino and Athamas mad, making them kill their own children? the goddess who cursed Semele to die after Zeus impregnated her? the goddess who prolonged the Trojan War out of spite for Paris rejecting her? the goddess who turned Queen Gerana into a crane for claiming to be more beautiful than her?:hera:0:silence.ogg:silence.ogg:win2.ogg:silence.ogg
