pdoor:0:0:26:26:0:10:0:28:0:What is the name of the legendary she-wolf who nursed the abandoned twins Romulus and Remus? the creature whose wolf-den (the Lupercal) became a sacred site in Rome? the wolf associated with Mars, the god of war? the she-wolf who was later honored with a statue in the Roman Forum? the wolf whose story was used to justify Rome’s brutal conquests? the wolf whose nurturing was seen as both miraculous and bestial? the wolf whose legacy lives on in modern Rome’s coat of arms and sports teams?:lupa:0:silence.ogg:silence.ogg:win2.ogg:silence.ogg
