pdoor:0:0:33:33:0:10:0:35:0:Who was the legendary founder and first king of Rome? the hero who survived abandonment as a baby and was nursed by a she-wolf (Lupa)? the ruler who established Rome on April 21, 753 BCE (according to legend)? the king who created the Roman Senate (Council of Elders)? the leader who introduced Rome’s first military and political systems? the ruler who established the Asylum, inviting outcasts and refugees to grow Rome’s population? the ruler who celebrated Rome’s first triumph after conquering the neighboring city of Veii? the king who vanished in a storm, later deified as the god Quirinus? :romulus:0:silence.ogg:silence.ogg:win2.ogg:silence.ogg
